
DATA "P4SENDX: FORK OF PETIT4SEND SWITCH"
DATA "FROM 2019/08/19 VER.1.2.2+L03"
DATA "ORIGINAL BY REI SOFTWARE / EDITED BY LTLAPY"
DATA ""
'Differences from the original version by Rei Software:
'Archives, parity, NS links, new screens, runs as a subprogram, screenshot send fixed.
'http://rei.to/petit4send.html
'////////////////////////////////////////////////
'USB TRANSMITTER FOR PETITCOM4
'PC->PETIT4
' BY USB KEYBOARD/MOUSE EMULATION
' MAX 296BYTE/SEC
